#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/records/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Records"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/records/CONTEXT.md
msgid "How long records are kept, how they are corrected, and how a person's own records reach them."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/records/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Language"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/records/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Record class**: A group of records sharing a retention period, trigger event and legal basis. _Avoid_: Retention category"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/records/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Disposal**: The scheduled, audited deletion of a record class at the end of its retention. _Avoid_: Purge, cleanup"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/records/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Correction request**: A request to change a recorded value, with its reason, evidence and approval; it produces a new version. _Avoid_: Edit, fix, update"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/records/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Individual disclosure**: The release of a person's own records to that person, their guardian or an authorised agency. _Avoid_: Export, data request, extract"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/records/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Purpose**: The declared reason a personal-data element is collected or a record is accessed. _Avoid_: Use case, justification"
msgstr ""
